### ============================================
### TECHNOLOGIES API — REST Client Tests
### ============================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@authUrl = {{baseUrl}}/auth
@techUrl = {{baseUrl}}/technologies
@projectsUrl = {{baseUrl}}/projects

@email = brayogakenye04@gmail.com
@password = hunter2hunter2

# existing project to test tech linking
@projectId = 0345f081-f78b-4e51-83ad-c87ca043a191


### ============================================
### 0. LOGIN (must run first — stores session cookie)
### ============================================
# @name login
POST {{authUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}


### ============================================
### 1. PUBLIC — LIST TECHNOLOGIES (should show seeded techs)
### GET /api/technologies
### ============================================
GET {{techUrl}}


### ============================================
### 2. PUBLIC — LIST FILTERED BY CATEGORY=frontend
### ============================================
GET {{techUrl}}?category=frontend


### ============================================
### 3. PUBLIC — LIST FILTERED BY CATEGORY=backend
### ============================================
GET {{techUrl}}?category=backend


### ============================================
### 4. PUBLIC — LIST FILTERED BY CATEGORY=database
### ============================================
GET {{techUrl}}?category=database


### ============================================
### 5. PUBLIC — SEARCH "postgres"
### ============================================
GET {{techUrl}}?search=postgres


### ============================================
### 6. PUBLIC — SORT BY CATEGORY ASC
### ============================================
GET {{techUrl}}?sortBy=category&sortOrder=asc


### ============================================
### 7. PUBLIC — LIST (invalid category, expect 400)
### ============================================
GET {{techUrl}}?category=garbage


### ============================================
### 8. PUBLIC — GROUPED BY CATEGORY
### GET /api/technologies/by-category
### Expected: { data: { frontend: [...], backend: [...], ... } }
### ============================================
GET {{techUrl}}/by-category


### ============================================
### 9. ADMIN — CREATE (happy path)
### POST /api/technologies
### Expected: 201 { data: { id, name, category, iconName } }
### ============================================
# @name createTech
POST {{techUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Svelte",
  "category": "frontend",
  "iconName": "Flame"
}


