### ============================================
### 27. ADMIN — LINK TECHNOLOGIES TO A PROJECT
### PUT /api/projects/:id with techIds
### (Uses existing project — requires it to exist)
### ============================================
PUT {{projectsUrl}}/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "techIds": [
    "{{createTech.response.body.$.data.id}}",
    "{{createTech2.response.body.$.data.id}}"
  ]
}


### ============================================
### 28. PUBLIC — VERIFY PROJECT NOW SHOWS TECHS
### GET /api/projects/slug/:slug
### Expected: data.techs = [{ technology: { name: "Svelte 5" } }, ...]
### ============================================
GET {{projectsUrl}}/slug/portfolio-backend-api


### ============================================
### 29. ADMIN — USAGE CHECK AFTER LINK (now 1 project)
### Expected: { usage: { projects: 1, services: 0, hasSkill: false } }
### ============================================
GET {{techUrl}}/{{createTech.response.body.$.data.id}}/usage


